{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25561","headline":"春山三朅来 二 · 李涉","name":"春山三朅来 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山上朅来采新茗，新花乱发前山顶。\n琼英动摇锺乳碧，业业高下随崖岭。\n未必蓬莱有仙药，能向鼎中云漠漠。\n越瓯遥见裂鼻香，欲觉身轻骑白鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}